{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" utility classes."}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"\n\nTailwind v4 likely"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" preserves default screens"}
