{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"\n\nThe header needs `relative` positioning. Absolute desktop navigation "}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"overlaps the logo and"}
