{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" z-index stacks incorrectly. The fix requires hiding"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" the desktop nav on "}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"mobile, adding `relative` to the header, correcting"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" z-index stacking, reducing"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" mobile padding, and"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" toggling the X icon"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" when open. `items-start`"}
