{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" with `items-center`."}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"\n\nI'll use `mq800` for"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" the responsive breakpoint"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" to match the project's"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" existing localhost "}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"conventions. The desktop"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" navigation will hide"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" below 800px, while "}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"the hamburger menu will"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" appear only on smaller"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" screens."}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"\n\nThe mobile overlay"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" and menu are controlled"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" by JavaScript, so they"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" do not need extra media"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" queries. The hamburger"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" will use `hidden mq800:flex`"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" and the desktop nav"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" `flex mq800:hidden`."}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" The overlay and menu"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" lack z-index values,"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" which causes stacking"}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" issues."}
{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"\n\nThe overlay currently blocks clicks on the mobile menu because it sits inside the header with a higher z-index. The menu needs a higher z-index than the overlay, or the overlay should sit below the menu. The header itself is sticky with z-50, so the menu must stack above the overlay at z-10 while keeping the overlay at z-40.\n\nThe overlay will paint first in the DOM, followed by the menu, so the overlay stays beneath the menu. Both elements will receive explicit z-index values. An `aria-controls` attribute will be added for accessibility. The component will be rewritten cleanly."}
{"type":"assistant-text","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":"The hamburger markup is already there, but it doesn’t work: desktop nav stays visible on small screens, and `md:` breakpoints don’t match this project’s `mq800` screens. Fixing the responsive show/hide and stacking now."}
