{"type":"assistant-thought","turnId":"7e7569df-151f-4fcf-87b9-d0b7695174c3","text":" z-index than the overlay so the top bar stays clickable.\n\nSettled on a concrete DOM structure to keep the hamburger button clickable. The header will use `relative z-50`, with the top row wrapped in a `relative z-50` container so the logo, navigation links, and hamburger button sit above the overlay. The overlay itself will be `fixed inset-0 z-40`, and the menu will be `absolute z-50`. This ensures the top bar remains interactive even while the overlay is active."}
